   "AnchorBarGrid"], Cell["applyToNumerator", "ObjectName"],
  Cell["Applies rules or a function to the numerator of each additive term in \
its existing form.", "Notes"],
  Cell[TextData[{Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"applyToNumerator", "[", "expr", ",",
         " ", "rules", "]"}]], "InlineFormula"], "  ", "applies one \
replacement rule or a list of rules to each term's numerator."}], "Usage"],
  Cell["Details", "NotesSection"], Cell["The function does not first combine \
denominators with Together and does not expand the expression. Each term of \
the sum as supplied is handled independently.", "Notes"],
  Cell["The denominator of each existing term is preserved. This makes it \
useful when applying diagram-local numerator identities while keeping \
physical propagators off shell.", "Notes"], Cell["Ordinary Mathematica \
evaluation of the input still occurs before the function receives it. It \
cannot undo simplifications already made by the evaluator.", "Notes"],
  Cell["Examples", "PrimaryExamplesSection"],
  Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["Load HEPCAT", "ExampleSubsection"],
     Cell["Evaluate this setup once before the examples. The paths refer to \
the local HEPCAT checkout; no model parameters are assigned global numerical \
values.", "ExampleText"], Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"If", "[", "!", "StringQ",
         "[", "Global`$HEPCATpath", "]", " ", "||", " ", "!", "DirectoryQ",
         "[", "Global`$HEPCATpath", "]", ",", "\n", " ", " ",
         "Global`$HEPCATpath", " ", "=", " ", "FileNameJoin", "[", "{",
         "First", "[", "PacletFind", "[", "\"HEPCAT\"", "]", "]", "[",
         "\"Location\"", "]", ",", " ", "\"source\"", "}", "]", "]", ";",
         "\n", "If", "[", "!", "MemberQ", "[", "$Packages", ",", " ",
         "\"ConstructiveDiagrams`\"", "]", ",", "\n", " ", " ", "Get", "[",
         "FileNameJoin", "[", "{", "Global`$HEPCATpath", ",", " ",
         "\"HEPCAT.wl\"", "}", "]", "]", "]", ";", "\n", "hepcatDirectory",
         " ", "=", " ", "ParentDirectory", "[", "Global`$HEPCATpath", "]",
         ";", "\n", "modelDirectory", " ", "=", " ", "FileNameJoin", "[",
         "{", "hepcatDirectory", ",", " ", "\"models\"", "}", "]", ";", "\n",
         "feynmanModelDirectory", " ", "=", " ", "FileNameJoin", "[", "{",
         "hepcatDirectory", ",", " ", "\"model_feynman\"", "}", "]", ";"}]],
      "Input", InitializationCell -> True]}, Open]],
  Cell["Basic Examples", "ExampleSection"],
  Cell["Replace numerator symbols without altering their denominators.",
   "ExampleText"], Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"applyToNumerator", "[", "(", "a",
